- synthetics-browser-workers
- synthetics-monitoring

Do NOT create one namespace per team for 2000 teams.

Use:
- logical team isolation
- IAM policies
- secret path restrictions
- RBAC in application
- queue routing


Reliability design

Must-have reliability features:

- Durable SQS queue
- DLQ for failed jobs
- idempotency key per monitor/location/scheduled_time
- scheduler lock in DynamoDB
- worker heartbeat
- hard timeout per check
- retry only platform failures
- do not retry real application failures blindly
- separate API and browser queues
- separate API and browser workers
- stagger schedules
- no all-checks-at-minute-zero design
- result classification
- audit table for every scheduled run

